  "title": "Traditional Welsh Rarebit",
  "description": "This Welsh rarebit recipe is a popular British dish simple to make at home with a rich, creamy Cheddar cheese and beer sauce broiled over toast.",
  "authors": [
    "Allyson"
  ],
